# .graphifyignore — required before the first `graphify extract`
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (confirmed in docs/research/graphify.md
# via the project's own README). Merges with .gitignore; only ever
# excludes more, never re-includes.
#
# Per docs/adr/0002-graphify-as-index-not-source-of-truth.md: logs/ and
# .scratch/ must never be indexed by default — logs/prompts/ especially
# relies on human/agent redaction discipline, not a technical guarantee,
# so it must never be blindly sent to a third-party LLM via graphify's
# semantic extraction pass.

logs/
.scratch/

.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# credential/secret-shaped files, defense in depth
*credential*
*secret*
*token*

node_modules/
__pycache__/
.git/

# unsanitized visual/test artifacts (relevant once Ozer generates
# browser fixtures/screenshots/recordings in later phases)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.mp4
*.mov
downloads/
recordings/
